All six match the `ownerAgent` names in the feature-task contracts; no task owner is missing. Agent descriptions are single-line, double-quoted YAML values, and every specialist has ownership, expertise, workflow, validation, constraints, output standards, and collaboration sections.

Preserved unchanged: `forge-team-builder`, `project-orchestrator`, `workflow-orchestrator`.

