`docs/SKILL-CANDIDATES.json` has 11 candidates:

- **9 `create`** — CLI command contract, registry/config, prerequisite doctor, container runtime contract, health-gated swap, destructive-operation safety, build layer, integration gate, packaging/docs sync.
