[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z ### 18.2 Risks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z |------|-----------|--------|------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Railpack cannot drive BuildKit under rootless Podman 5.7.0–5.8.x | Medium | High — core premise | Phase 0 spike is a hard gate; stop and re-plan if it fails |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Railpack pre-1.0 breaking changes | High over time | Medium — build breakage | Exact version pin, checksum, explicit upgrade task, fixtures detect regressions |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Podman 4.9 hosts (Ubuntu/Debian stock) cannot run v1 | High | Medium — install friction | Documented upgrade path; `doctor` explains the minimum and the fix |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Hosts already on Podman 6.x cannot run v1 while that line is unstable | Medium | Medium — install friction | `doctor` rejects 6.x and documents downgrading to the newest 5.8.x package; revisit once 6.x is stable and the BuildKit spike passes |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.824Z | Rootless port <1024 cannot bind | Medium | Low — confusing failure | Validate ports >= 1024 with a specific message |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | Builds are slow (minutes) | High | Medium — operator frustration | Honest docs, streamed output, config-only updates skip builds, BuildKit cache guidance |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | Disk growth from images and cache | Medium | Medium — host fills up | Keep two images, `doctor` reports sizes and warns, manual prune documented |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | Secret leakage through logs or JSON | Low | High | Redaction tests, `0600`, never echo env values, threat model documented |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | Swap window causes brief downtime | High | Low — accepted | Documented explicitly; no proxy in v1 |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | Single maintainer and thin real-world testing | Medium | Medium | Release-gate scenarios, fixtures, integration suite on the real host |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:19.825Z | `--restart=always` silently ineffective without lingering | High | High — apps die on reboot | `doctor` check plus release-gate reboot scenario |
