[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:37.257Z 166:### 5.4 Platform finding that shaped the scope
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:37.257Z 168:The reference host runs Podman 4.9.3, which is out of security support and also what stock Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 12 ship. Supporting it would mean owning rootless BuildKit bugs on an unmaintained runtime, so v1 requires Podman `>= 5.7.0, < 6.0.0` and treats upgrading the host as a prerequisite. Version 6.x is explicitly excluded because the major line is still unstable; the supported window is the current 5.x line from 5.7.0 onward. This is a deliberate trade: a smaller support matrix in exchange for a build layer that can actually work.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-30T20:48:37.257Z ### 5.4 Platform finding that shaped the scope
