[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * `update` orchestration (UPD-FR-01 … UPD-FR-05, UPD-NF-01, UPD-NF-02).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * One update performs exactly one of three transitions, decided before any
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * container, volume, image, or config file is touched:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * - **no-op** — the diff found nothing to do and the live container is running
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   from the recorded image with recorded health. It reports "nothing changed"
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   and exits 0. For a git-backed app the configured ref is fetched first; a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   moved commit turns the no-op into a rebuild instead of silently ignoring
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   the new source (the PRD's core "update after a push" loop).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * - **config-only** — only run-time settings changed (or the recorded container
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   is missing, stopped, or unhealthy). The recorded image is recreated with
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   the desired settings through the health-gated swap, with no Railpack or
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   BuildKit invocation (UPD-FR-05). The image pair in `state.json` is left
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   untouched, so a config-only update never destroys the rollback target. If
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   the recreated container fails, the previous image restarts with the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   previously applied port, bind, volumes, probe, and environment.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * - **rebuild** — the source or an unknown difference requires a new image.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   The workspace is fetched and checked out, the candidate image is built, and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   only after a successful build is the old container stopped and swapped. A
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *   build failure therefore leaves the serving version untouched (exit 3).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * Ordering rules that the implementation keeps:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * 1. the app name and registry record are resolved, then the per-app lock is
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    acquired for the entire operation (including the diff), and released in
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    `finally` on every path;
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * 2. every read-only preflight check — config validation, cross-app port
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    conflict, volume ownership, secrets-file parsing — runs before the first
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    mutation (`PRD-NF-03`);
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * 3. `config.toml` is written only after the operation succeeds, and never on a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    failed build or a reverted swap; the candidate image is recorded by the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    swap itself, only after a healthy probe;
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * 4. the recorded pair is pruned only after a successful transition: retention
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    keeps exactly the current and previous image and never touches an image
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    that is in use or shared (`RBK-FR-02`). A retention failure is a warning,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *    because the app is already serving.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * Every phase is reported through {@link UpdateOutput} so an operator can tell
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * a slow build from a stuck probe (`UPD-NF-02`). The builder, runtime, probe,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * workspace source, swap, state writer, output, and clock are injected, so the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  * unit suite exercises every class with no Podman, git, or network.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:31.807Z  */
