[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.921Z # easy-host
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.921Z ## 1. Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.921Z **Product Name:** easy-host
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 166:### 5.4 Platform finding that shaped the scope
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 167-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 168-The reference host runs Podman 4.9.3, which is out of security support and also what stock Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 12 ship. Supporting it would mean owning rootless BuildKit bugs on an unmaintained runtime, so v1 requires Podman `>= 5.7.0, < 6.0.0` and treats upgrading the host as a prerequisite. Version 6.x is explicitly excluded because the major line is still unstable; the supported window is the current 5.x line from 5.7.0 onward. This is a deliberate trade: a smaller support matrix in exchange for a build layer that can actually work.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 169-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 170-### 5.5 Design principles
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 171-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 172-- **One observable outcome per command.** No command silently does two jobs.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 173-- **Fail before mutating.** Validate config, ports, names, and prerequisites before touching a container.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 174-- **Never destroy data implicitly.** Volumes and host paths require an explicit flag.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 175-- **Say what happened and what to run next.** Every failure names the failed check and a remediation command.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 176-- **Prefer plain files over opaque state.** The operator can read, copy, and repair the registry.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 177-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 178----
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DOC-1.4 attempt=3 at=2026-10-30T20:50:44.922Z 179-
